# AgileFlow\par
\par
AgileFlow is an Agile project management platform for workspace-based teams. It supports authenticated workspaces, projects, sprints, Kanban boards, task assignment, dependency tracking, submit/review approval flow, dashboard summaries, account profiles, email verification, and workflow email notifications.\par
\par
The current application is a .NET 8 API backend with a React 19 + TypeScript + Vite frontend. The backend owns the business rules for workspace roles, task approval, dependency validation, sprint completion, email audit logs, and database migrations.\par
\par
## Main Features\par
\par
- JWT authentication with refresh tokens and email verification.\par
- Account profile editing and upload-only profile pictures.\par
- Workspace, member, project, sprint, board, and task management.\par
- Role-based permissions:\par
  - Admin: member management plus delivery management.\par
  - TeamLead: project, sprint, board, task, assignment, dependency, and review management.\par
  - Developer: assigned task editing and submit-for-review.\par
- Task lifecycle with commit submission, approval/rejection comments, dependency gates, and activity logs.\par
- Sprint progress and dashboard aggregate APIs.\par
- SMTP-backed email notifications with audited delivery logs and due-date reminders.\par
- React dashboard UI with TanStack Query, Axios, React Hook Form, Zod, dnd-kit, Recharts, and Tailwind.\par
- Postman/Newman and Playwright workflow coverage.\par
\par
