## Local Development\par
\par
Prerequisites:\par
\par
- .NET 8 SDK\par
- Node.js 20+\par
- SQL Server LocalDB or SQL Server\par
- Optional: smtp4dev or another SMTP test inbox\par
\par
Backend:\par
\par
```powershell\par
dotnet run --project backend/API/API.csproj\par
```\par
\par
The API uses `backend/API/Properties/launchSettings.json` for local development defaults. Startup applies EF Core migrations automatically with `Database.Migrate()`.\par
\par
Frontend:\par
\par
```powershell\par
cd frontend\par
npm install\par
npm run dev\par
```\par
\par
The frontend defaults to `VITE_API_URL=http://localhost:6358` and runs on Vite at `http://127.0.0.1:5173`.\par
\par
Verification:\par
\par
```powershell\par
dotnet build backend/AgileFlow.slnx -c Release\par
cd frontend\par
npm run lint -- --format stylish\par
npm run build\par
cd ..\par
npm run postman:test\par
npm run e2e\par
```\par
