## Current Notes\par
\par
- Registering a user sends an email verification link and does not issue tokens until the account is confirmed.\par
- Existing workflow rules are enforced server-side; frontend controls are convenience only and are not the source of authorization.\par
- Sprint completion requires every task in the sprint to be `Done` and `Approved`.\par
- Tasks can enter `Done` only after review approval and after dependencies are also done and approved.\par
- Profile pictures are uploaded to the API and served from `/uploads/profile-pictures/...`; raw URL entry is intentionally not part of the profile flow.\par
